<item><title>Mkaka dares accusers to produce evidence of corruption</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/mkaka-dares-accusers-to-produce-evidence-of-corruption-fd13fa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/mkaka-dares-accusers-to-produce-evidence-of-corruption-fd13fa/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>Former Malawi Congress Party Secretary General Eisenhower Mkaka says he will open his assets to anti-corruption investigators if they have reasonable grounds to suspect wrongdoing.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:10:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Malawi health workers threaten walkout</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-health-workers-threaten-walkout-058568/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-health-workers-threaten-walkout-058568/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>A coalition of health workers has given the government a 14-day ultimatum to address critical shortages and staffing issues.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 07:36:48 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-health-workers-threaten-walkout-058568/share.jpg" length="35863" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-health-workers-threaten-walkout-058568/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Court fines three men K800,000 each over 670 litres of petrol</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/court-fines-three-men-k800-000-each-over-670-litres-of-7634c6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/court-fines-three-men-k800-000-each-over-670-litres-of-7634c6/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The fuel has been forfeited to the government after the men were found with it in Dwangwa, Nkhotakota District.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:25:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Malawi court delays ex-army chief Phiri&apos;s corruption trial</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-court-delays-ex-army-chief-phiri-s-corruption-trial-983374/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-court-delays-ex-army-chief-phiri-s-corruption-trial-983374/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The Anti-Corruption Bureau cited unpreparedness as prosecutors failed to open the case against General Paul Phiri on five charges.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:34:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
